.TH CHM-RETRO-EMULATOR-BUILD 1
.SH NAME
chm-retro-emulator-build \- compile pinned PUAE and VICE providers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B retro/commodore/build-emulator-providers.sh
.RI [ --out DIRECTORY ] [ --jobs N ]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --out DIRECTORY
Output directory for puae_libretro.so, x64sc, x64, c1541 and checksums.
.TP
.B --jobs N
Parallel build jobs. Default: 2.
.SH SOURCE
Builds pinned upstream PUAE and VICE revisions; see retro/commodore/README.md for commit IDs and license information.
